{"unit_id":"tag:00YK:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是位点（site）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 点（points）的族（family）<MATH_0002> 称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>保守的（conservative）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若每个层（sheaves）的映射（map）<MATH_0003>，只要在所有纤维（fibres）<MATH_0004> 上都是同构（isomorphism），它就是同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 称 <MATH_0005> <TEXTITOPEN_0002>有足够点（has enough points）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若存在点（points）的保守（conservative）族（family）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"conservative","target_term":"保守的"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"has enough points","target_term":"有足够点"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"conservative","target_term":"保守"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"conservative","target_term":"保守的","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"conservative","target_term":"保守","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"has enough points","target_term":"有足够点","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
