{"unit_id":"tag:00YL:proof","translation":"将反复使用所有茎（stalk）函子（functors）都与任意有限极限（finite limits）及余极限（colimits）交换（commute），从而与积（products）、纤维（fibred）积（products）等交换这一事实。还将使用单射（injective）映射（maps）就是单态射（monomorphisms），满射（surjective）映射（maps）就是满态射（epimorphisms）。层（sheaves）的映射（map）<MATH_0001> 是单射的（injective），当且仅当 <MATH_0002> 是同构（isomorphism）。由此得到 (1)。类似地，<MATH_0003> 是满射的（surjective），当且仅当 <MATH_0004> 是同构（isomorphism）。由此得到 (2)。映射（maps）<MATH_0005> 相等，当且仅当 <MATH_0006> 是同构（isomorphism）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>等化子（equalizer）可用积（products）和纤维积（fibre products）表示，见范畴（Categories）章引理 <REF_0001> 的证明。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。由此得到 (3)。断言 (4) 和 (5) 直接由定义及本证明开头的注记得到。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"stalk","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"fibred","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"monomorphisms","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"epimorphisms","target_term":"满态射"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"stalk","target_term":"茎","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"functors","tar