{"unit_id":"tag:00YM:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是位点（site），并设 <MATH_0002> 是点（points）的族（family）。此族（family）保守（conservative），当且仅当对每个层（sheaf）<MATH_0003>、每个 <MATH_0004> 及每对不同的截面（sections）<MATH_0005>、<MATH_0006>，存在 <MATH_0007> 和 <MATH_0008>，使得三元组（triples）<MATH_0009> 和 <MATH_0010> 定义 <MATH_0011> 的不同元素（elements）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"conservative","target_term":"保守"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"triples","target_term":"三元组"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"conservative","target_term":"保守","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"triples","target_term":"三元组","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00YM:proof","translation":"假设此族（family）保守（conservative），且 <MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002> 及 <MATH_0003> 如引理中所述。截面（sections）<MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005> 定义彼此不同的映射（maps）<MATH_0006>。因此，由引理 <REF_0001>，存在 <MATH_0007> 使得 <MATH_0008>。由引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003>，回忆有 <MATH_0009>。因此存在 <MATH_0010>，使得在 <MATH_0012> 中有 <MATH_0011>。展开定义，可见 <MATH_0013> 和 <MATH_0014> 如引理的陈述中所述。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n为证明逆命题，假设引理中关于点（points）存在的条件。设 <MATH_0015> 是层（sheaves）的映射（map），在所有茎（stalks）处均为同构（isomorphism）。须证明 <MATH_0016> 既单射（injective）又满射（surjective），见引理 <REF_0004>。单射性（Injectivity）直接由假设得到。为证明满射性（surjectivity），须证明 <MATH_0017> 是同构（isomorphism）（范畴（Categories）章引理 <REF_0005>）。由于此映射（map）显然满射（surjective），只须核对单射性（injectivity）；这由按假设 <MATH_0018> 在所有茎（stalks）处单射（injective）得到。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"conservative","target_term":"保守"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Injectivity","target_term":"单射性"},{"source_term":"surjectivity","target_term":"满射性"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"injectivity","target_term":"单射性"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"conservative","target_term":"保守","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term